{"_meta":{"openai/toolInvocation/invoked":"Itinerary customized","openai/toolInvocation/invoking":"Customizing itinerary"},"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"Customize a trip itinerary"},"description":"Use this when a traveler wants to change a See Sight Tours multi-day trip: remove, add or reorder days, swap an activity or hotel, set the start date or the party, or split one trip into two separate itineraries. Start from a trip id (search_products or get_product) or from the plan_id of an earlier result to keep editing. Returns each variant day by day with the changes listed, the price the website shows for the unchanged trip (changes to days, activities or hotels are priced by the trip team in a quote, never estimated here), a shareable seesight-tours.com page and a request-form link. Nothing is booked or stored; the trip team receives the plan only when the guest submits the form on the website. Do not use for day tours.","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"changes":{"description":"Changes in order; may be empty to re-read or split a saved plan.","items":{"anyOf":[{"additionalProperties":false,"description":"Drop a day; later days move up.","properties":{"day":{"maximum":30,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"op":{"const":"remove_day","type":"string"}},"required":["op","day"],"type":"object"},{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"after_day":{"description":"0 inserts before day 1.","maximum":30,"minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"op":{"const":"add_day","type":"string"},"overnight":{"description":"Overnight city; defaults to the previous day's.","maxLength":60,"type":"string"},"summary":{"maxLength":240,"type":"string"},"title":{"maxLength":80,"minLength":2,"type":"string"}},"required":["op","after_day","title"],"type":"object"},{"additionalProperties":false,"description":"Reorde